 weather reason for cancelling KC18K6 or S61CZX?"}, "resultat": "Thanks for the detailed breakdown.\n\nRegarding the cancellations, I do not have a health or weather-related reason. So, it seems I can't cancel KC18K6 or S61CZX based on the duration. That's fine.\n\nFor the upgrade, yes, please proceed with the business class upgrade for H8Q05L for $163.", "erreur": null}
